  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is the midpoint of the segment between the axes, them point &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>The equation of the line is,&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>or,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>The line perpendicular to it is of form,&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>Since it passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Line is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>",
